# Store and check out every text file with LF.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) hands the working tree
# CRLF while git stores LF. Everything still builds, and CI is unaffected
# because it runs on Linux -- but `npx prettier --check` locally reports every
# file as misformatted, which makes the one check that matters untrustworthy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these; line-ending conversion corrupts them.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.pt binary
